+/// What preparing a placement move produced ([`repoint_chunk`]). **No arm has written
+/// anything**: only the caller's own [`MetadataStore::commit`] of a [`Self::Prepared`] batch
+/// mutates the store, so a refusal and a conflict alike leave every record byte-identical.
+#[derive(Debug)]
+pub enum Repoint {
+    /// The move, as ONE compare-and-swap batch: the record that holds the chunk's
+    /// [`ChunkRef`] repointed, conditioned on the bytes the move weighed.
+    ///
+    /// Handed back rather than committed here so the caller can add **its own evidence for the
+    /// same move** — a repair obligation's delete, an orphan mark per displaced position — and
+    /// land all of it in ONE atomic mutation (`0005:277`, ADR-0015): committing the placement and
+    /// the evidence separately leaves a window in which a fragment has moved and nothing records
+    /// where it went.
